<title>UK: Bear Stearns sets $250 mln seven-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Bear Stearns sets $250 mln seven-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Bear Stearns.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BEAR STEARNS COS INC</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	BASE	 1M-LIBOR  MATURITY    26.JUN.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +25 BP    PAY DATE    26.JUN.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A2	  ISS PRICE  99.6537   FULL FEES   30 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A	   REOFFER    99.6537</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    =	   HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    20 BP     SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	CALL FROM 26.JUN.00</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
